node_modules/
apps/desktop/build/
apps/desktop/.svelte-kit/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/
.DS_Store

# AI-agent session scratch — never part of the repo
.superpowers/
.remember/
.claude/settings.local.json
# Skills installed per-machine by whoever is working here. Not project-owned:
# they carry their own compiled artefacts (__pycache__), they differ per person,
# and committing one would ship someone's local tooling to everyone who clones.
#
# `**/` and not a bare `.claude/skills/`: a pattern with an interior slash is
# ANCHORED to the directory holding this file, so the bare form covered the repo
# root and nothing else. A skill dropped in apps/desktop/ or crates/ would have
# been committed. Verified with `git check-ignore` before and after this change,
# not assumed from the docs.
**/.claude/skills/
# The isolated worktrees this repo's agent workflow creates live under here too.
**/.claude/worktrees/
